# Changelog

## 2026-06-02 (analysis & editor)

### Added (backend)

- `Resume.analysis_data` — JSON field for AI diagnosis results.
- `llm_service.analyze_resume` — strict HR director scoring with `MOCK_ANALYSIS_DATA` fallback.
- `PUT /api/resume/{id}` — save frontend-edited `parsed_data`.
- `POST /api/analyze/{id}` — diagnose resume JSON, persist `analysis_data`.
- SQLite startup migration for `analysis_data` column on existing databases.

### Changed (backend)

- `POST /api/optimize/{id}` — accepts JSON body from client; syncs result to both `optimized_data` and `parsed_data`.
- `GET /api/resume/{id}` — returns `analysis_data`.

### Added (frontend)

- `AnalysisData` type and `normalizeAnalysisData`; `ResumeResponse` includes `analysis_data`.
- `updateResume`, `analyzeResume` API helpers; `optimizeResume` sends current form JSON in body.
- Editor「💾 保存修改」with loading guard and Toast feedback.
- Form CRUD: add/remove education, experience, and projects.
- Right panel「📊 AI 简历诊断」— score card (color by tier), strengths / weaknesses / suggestions, re-diagnose.

### Changed (frontend)

- `EditorWorkbench` — optimize and analyze pass live `data`; load cached `analysis_data` on init.
- `ResumePreview` — single-column ATS-friendly layout (header → summary → experience → education → skills); `print:break-inside-avoid` on entries.

## 2026-06-02 (preview)

### Added

- `frontend/src/components/ResumePreview.tsx` — A4 two-column resume layout (white background, bold section headings, bullet lists) driven by live form JSON.
- `frontend/src/components/ResumePreviewModal.tsx` — full-screen preview modal with `react-to-print` PDF export; modal chrome hidden when printing.
- Editor header button「📄 预览并导出 PDF」— opens preview modal synced with current editor state.

### Changed

- `frontend/package.json` — add `react-to-print` and `lucide-react` dependencies.
- `frontend/src/app/editor/[id]/EditorWorkbench.tsx` — integrate preview modal and export action.

## 2026-06-02 (editor)

### Added

- `frontend/src/app/editor/[id]/EditorWorkbench.tsx` — split-pane editor: loads `parsed_data` via `GET /api/resume/{id}`, Feishu-style form on the left, AI panel on the right.
- `frontend/src/components/AutoTextarea.tsx` — auto-resizing textarea for experience and project descriptions.
- `frontend/src/types/resume.ts` — `ResumeData` types and `normalizeResumeData` helper.
- `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` — `getResume` and `optimizeResume` fetch helpers.

### Changed

- `frontend/src/app/editor/[id]/page.tsx` — render `EditorWorkbench` instead of placeholder.
- `frontend/src/app/globals.css` — skeleton pulse animation for AI panel loading state.

## 2026-06-02 (frontend)

### Added

- `frontend/src/app/page.tsx` — Notion-style home page with click/drag PDF upload, loading states, and auto parse + redirect to `/editor/[id]`.
- `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx` — root layout with metadata and `ToastProvider`.
- `frontend/src/components/Toast.tsx` — toast notifications for network and API errors.
- `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` — `uploadResume` and `parseResume` fetch helpers against `localhost:8000`.
- `frontend/src/app/editor/[id]/page.tsx` — editor route placeholder after successful parse.

### Changed

- Migrated App Router from `frontend/app/` to `frontend/src/app/`; moved `favicon.ico`.
- `frontend/tsconfig.json` — `@/*` path alias points to `./src/*`.
- `frontend/src/app/globals.css` — Notion-inspired palette and loading animations; system font stack (no Google Fonts at build time).

### Removed

- Default Next.js starter pages under `frontend/app/`.

## 2026-06-02 (LLM)

### Added

- `backend/llm_service.py` — OpenAI integration: `parse_to_json`, `optimize_experience`; mock fallback when key is missing or call fails.
- `POST /api/parse/{id}` — parse `raw_text` to structured JSON, save `parsed_data`.
- `POST /api/optimize/{id}` — STAR-optimize experience in `parsed_data`, save `optimized_data`.

### Changed

- `backend/main.py` — wire parse and optimize routes to `llm_service`.
- `backend/API.md` — document parse/optimize endpoints, JSON schema, and LLM env config.
- `README.md` — endpoint table, `.env` setup note for `OPENAI_API_KEY`.

## 2026-06-02

### Added

- `.cursor/rules/project-global-standards.mdc` — always-on Cursor rules: stack (Next.js + Tailwind / FastAPI + SQLite), minimal code style, SQLite single-table by resume ID, LLM try-except with mock fallback.

### Changed

- `README.md` — project overview and link to Cursor project standards.
- `.gitignore` — ignore `package-lock.json`.

## 2026-06-02 (backend)

### Added

- `backend/database.py` — SQLAlchemy sync SQLite engine (`resume.db`), session factory, `get_db` dependency.
- `backend/models.py` — `Resume` model: UUID `id`, `filename`, `raw_text`, `parsed_data`, `optimized_data`.
- `backend/main.py` — FastAPI app with CORS, lifespan table creation, health / upload / resume routes.
- `backend/run.py` — uvicorn dev server startup script (`python run.py`).
- `backend/API.md` — REST API documentation (endpoints, request/response, errors).

### Changed

- `README.md` — backend quick start and API endpoint summary.
